  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "事件對照（stateMachine.ts）",
      "items": [
        "SPEC_PROPOSED：Claude 呼叫 propose_spec；在 spec_review 再呼叫會產生新版規格，狀態不變",
        "SPEC_CHANGES_REQUESTED／SPEC_APPROVED：你在規格頁要求修改或核准",
        "REPORT_SUBMITTED：Harness 整理完報告；REPORT_FEEDBACK：你在報告上留回饋",
        "DISCARDED：clarifying 到 reviewing 都可以丟棄"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "與 status 並行的 runState",
      "items": [
        "idle · running · waiting_permission · finalizing · interrupted · error",
        "等待指令核准時 runState 是 waiting_permission，status 不變",
        "關閉 app 時進行中的執行標為 interrupted，下次可按「繼續」",
        "整理報告失敗時 status 仍是 implementing，runState 為 error 並保留待整理的報告"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "狀態決定權限階段（phaseOf）",
      "items": [
        "clarifying、spec_review → clarify：只能讀檔與搜尋",
        "implementing → implement：worktree 內讀寫自動允許",
        "done、discarded → closed；分岔對話一律是 branch 階段"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "實作細節",
      "items": [
        "你觸發的轉換若送訊息給 Claude 失敗，status 會還原（transitionAndSend）",
        "reviewing → done 由 merge／createPullRequest 直接設定，FINISHED 事件有定義但沒有被使用"
      ]
    }
  ]
